{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121849","id":4149439521,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc73U2wh","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121849","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121849.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121849.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121849","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121849/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121849/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121849/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/51f7b5f6ba98a9fd8a162036643e11f6891982b5","number":121849,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Automate Android & Java SDK setup","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis PR introduces the `AndroidSDKManager` class which is used to automate the download, setup and management of the Android and Java SDK in the Godot editor.\r\n- Android SDK setup: \r\n  - `AndroidSDKManager` checks whether `export/android/android_sdk_path` in the Editor Settings is valid. \r\n  - If not, it prompts the user to download and set up the Android SDK. \r\n  - If the user accepts, `AndroidSDKManager` downloads and uses the [Android CLI](https://developer.android.com/tools/agents/android-cli/) to query, set up and update the Android SDK packages used by the Godot editor.\r\n  - The install is done in a location specific to the Godot editor, and `export/android/android_sdk_path` is updated once the set up is complete with the new location.\r\n- Java SDK setup: \r\n  - `AndroidSDKManager` checks for the presence of a valid Java SDK at the path specified by `export/android/java_sdk_path` in the Editor Settings.\r\n  - If the install is invalid or missing, it prompts the user to download and set up the Java SDK.\r\n  - If the user accepts, `AndroidSDKManager` downloads and sets up a version of the Java SDK from https://adoptium.net/.\r\n  - The install is done in a location specific to the Godot editor, and `export/android/java_sdk_path` is updated once the set up is complete with the new location.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/46a496f5-4047-463e-9cb0-ba5f53a167a5\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe feature is can be accessed from two locations:\r\n- It shows in the `Export Presets` window when an Android preset is added, and the editor detects that the Android / Java SDK is not valid.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"896\" height=\"562\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-10 at 12 14 20 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/69fac43d-beba-4bcb-8462-06a1a726d5be\" />\r\n\r\n- The `Install Android Build Template...` in the Project menu was renamed to `Setup Android Build...`. The updated button triggers the prompt for installing the Android / Java SDK when it detects they are not properly set up.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"382\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-10 at 12 20 30 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e6553c64-f3ff-4fb1-8af4-23473bc25653\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAdvanced users still have the ability to set up and configure the Android and/or Java SDK on their own if desired.\r\n\r\nRemaining TODOs:\r\n- [x] Testing and validation on Windows\r\n- [x] Testing and validation on Linux\r\n- [x] Testing and validation on MacOS\r\n- [x] Check for online access prior to downloading SDKs\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","description":"",